    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Being able to do something",
     "texto": [
      "To say you can or cannot achieve a result, use **verb + 得/不 + result or quality**: **看得懂** = can understand by reading; **看不懂** = cannot understand it by reading.",
      "The pattern is similar to the result complement you saw before, but here **得/不** expresses possibility or ability, not how the action is done."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
