    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Giving instructions",
     "texto": [
      "**应该** expresses what is advisable or expected; **要求** is a more direct instruction or request. **注意** means to pay attention.",
      "**愿意** expresses willingness or readiness. It is not the same as **应该**: wanting to do something is different from thinking it is what you should do."
     ],
